.IX Title "LTPCOUNTER 1"
.TH LTPCOUNTER 1 2025-11-26 "perl v5.38.2" "LTP executables"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
ltpcounter \- LTP reception test program
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBltpcounter\fR \fIclient_ID\fR [\fImax_nbr_of_bytes\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBltpcounter\fR uses LTP to receive service data units flagged with client
service number \fIclient_ID\fR from a remote \fBltpdriver\fR client service
process.  When the total number of bytes of client service data it has
received exceeds \fImax_nbr_of_bytes\fR, it terminates and prints reception
and cancellation statistics.  If \fImax_nbr_of_bytes\fR is omitted, the default
limit is 2 billion bytes.
.PP
While receiving data, \fBltpcounter\fR prints a 'v' character every 5 seconds
to indicate that it is still alive.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.IX Header "EXIT STATUS"
.IP """0""" 4
.IX Item """0"""
\&\fBltpcounter\fR has terminated.  Any problems encountered during operation
will be noted in the \fBion.log\fR log file.
.IP """1""" 4
.IX Item """1"""
\&\fBltpcounter\fR was unable to start, because it could not attach to the LTP
protocol on the local node or could not open access to client service
\&\fIclientId\fR.
.Sp
In the former case, run \fBltpadmin\fR to start LTP and try again.
.Sp
In the latter case, some other client service task has already opened
access to client service \fIclientId\fR.  If no such task is currently running
(e.g., it crashed while holding the client service open), use \fBltpadmin\fR to
stop and restart the LTP protocol.
.SH FILES
.IX Header "FILES"
No configuration files are needed.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.IX Header "ENVIRONMENT"
No environment variables apply.
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
.IX Header "DIAGNOSTICS"
Diagnostic messages produced by \fBltpcounter\fR are written to the ION log
file \fIion.log\fR.
.IP "ltpcounter can't initialize LTP." 4
.IX Item "ltpcounter can't initialize LTP."
\&\fBltpadmin\fR has not yet initialized LTP protocol operations.
.IP "ltpcounter can't open client access." 4
.IX Item "ltpcounter can't open client access."
Another task has opened access to service client \fIclientId\fR and has not yet
relinquished it.
.IP "Can't get LTP notice." 4
.IX Item "Can't get LTP notice."
LTP system error.  Check for earlier diagnostic messages describing
the cause of the error; correct problem and rerun.
.SH BUGS
.IX Header "BUGS"
Report bugs to <https://github.com/nasa\-jpl/ION\-DTN/issues>
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBltpadmin\fR\|(1), \fBltpdriver\fR\|(1), \fBltp\fR\|(3)
